# Agent & Navigation Guidelines

Always read and follow the master guidelines and codebase index before running searches:
- **Master Guidelines**: `.agents/AGENTS.md`
- **Codebase Architecture & Fast-Lookup**: `.agents/planning/CODEBASE_MAP.md`
- **Cursor Rules**: `.agents/.cursorrules`

## Command: /update-agents
When the user types `/update-agents`:
- Scan `client/app/`, `client/components/`, and `client/lib/` for any new or modified files.
- Synchronize `.agents/planning/CODEBASE_MAP.md` with the current structure.
- Present a summary of updates made to the map.
